WEBVTT

00:03.753 --> 00:05.255
Are ya ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:05.338 --> 00:06.840
I can't  hear  you.
我听不到你说话。

00:06.923 --> 00:08.425
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain.
孩子们：
是的，是的，船长。

00:08.508 --> 00:11.511
♪ Ohh... ♪
♪ 哦...♪

00:11.594 --> 00:13.596
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:13.680 --> 00:15.724
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:15.807 --> 00:17.517
Captain: ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
队长：♪ 吸水性的，黄色的
他是多孔的 ♪

00:17.600 --> 00:19.352
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:19.436 --> 00:21.646
Captain: ♪ If nautical nonsense
be somethin' you wish ♪
船长：♪ 如果是航海方面的废话
成为你所希望的那样 ♪

00:21.730 --> 00:23.648
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:23.732 --> 00:25.525
Captain: ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
船长：♪ 然后降落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:25.608 --> 00:26.693
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:26.776 --> 00:28.236
Captain: ♪ Ready? ♪
队长：♪ 准备好了吗？ ♪

00:28.319 --> 00:29.529
All: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
全部： ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:29.612 --> 00:31.614
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:31.698 --> 00:33.616
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:33.700 --> 00:37.162
Captain: ♪ SpongeBob
SquarePants ♪
队长：♪ 海绵宝宝
方裤♪

01:01.102 --> 01:03.062
: Ohh...
: 哦...

01:03.146 --> 01:05.774
What the  ... Now?
什么……现在？

01:05.857 --> 01:08.109
SpongeBob: ♪ La-la-la,
la, la-la-la ♪
海绵宝宝：♪ 啦啦啦，
啦啦啦啦♪

01:08.193 --> 01:09.444
♪ La, la, la ♪
♪ 啦啦啦 ♪

01:09.527 --> 01:11.196
Stop!
停止！

01:11.279 --> 01:14.824
What could you possibly be
trying to do this time?
你可能是什么
这次想做什么？

01:14.908 --> 01:16.534
I'm not  trying  to do anything.
我并不想做任何事。

01:16.618 --> 01:18.453
I'm just having
a decent morning.
我只是有
一个体面的早晨。

01:18.536 --> 01:21.164
By running around and
screaming like a banshee?
通过四处奔走和
像女妖一样尖叫？

01:21.247 --> 01:24.626
Oh, Squidward, a banshee
screams like this:
哦，章鱼哥，女妖
像这样尖叫：

01:24.709 --> 01:27.420
: Ahh...
: 啊...

01:29.005 --> 01:30.590
There are two
kinds of people.
有两个
各种各样的人。

01:30.673 --> 01:32.550
There are people
that are normal...
还有人
那是正常的...

01:34.260 --> 01:36.262
and then there's you.
然后就是你了。

01:36.346 --> 01:37.305
Really?
真的吗？

01:37.388 --> 01:38.598
Yes, really!
是的，真的！

01:38.681 --> 01:40.016
Maybe you should start acting
也许你应该开始演戏

01:40.099 --> 01:43.102
a little more  normal!
正常一点！

01:43.186 --> 01:44.437
: Dah!
： 哎呀！

01:44.521 --> 01:46.689
I'm not normal?
我不正常吗？

01:49.484 --> 01:51.778
: Ahh.
: 啊。

01:51.861 --> 01:53.696
Squidward...
章鱼哥...

01:53.780 --> 01:56.199
how does one become normal?
一个人如何变得正常？

01:56.282 --> 01:58.743
Well, how about you start by...
好吧，你从...开始怎么样？

01:58.827 --> 02:02.539
getting away from me,
you little creature!
远离我，
你这个小生物！

02:02.622 --> 02:04.457
What's wrong with me?
我怎么了？

02:04.541 --> 02:07.377
I need to understand  normal.
我需要理解正常。

02:07.460 --> 02:10.296
SpongeBob: "How to Be Normal."
海绵宝宝：“如何变得正常。”

02:10.380 --> 02:12.507
Hm, this videotape should help.
嗯，这个录像带应该有帮助。

02:12.590 --> 02:15.051
Are you tired of
being called a freak?
你厌倦了吗
被称为怪胎？

02:15.134 --> 02:16.970
Do people throw you
out of their homes?
人们会扔你吗
离开他们的家？

02:17.053 --> 02:18.137
Well, do they?
嗯，是吗？

02:18.221 --> 02:19.764
Yes, yes and yes.
是的，是的，是的。

02:19.848 --> 02:22.642
Then join me as I take you on
然后加入我，我带你去

02:22.725 --> 02:25.019
a "Journey Into Normality."
“回归常态之旅”。

02:25.103 --> 02:26.813
Normality.
常态。

02:26.896 --> 02:28.982
The life of a normal person
is relatively simple.
一个正常人的生活
比较简单。

02:29.065 --> 02:33.236
Here is your typical average Joe
on his way to work.
这是典型的普通乔
在上班的路上。

02:33.319 --> 02:34.779
See how he is dressed.
看看他穿得怎么样。

02:34.863 --> 02:37.615
Even his hair is boring.
甚至他的头发也很无聊。

02:37.699 --> 02:39.909
Notice his features,
nice and smooth
注意他的特点，
漂亮又光滑

02:39.993 --> 02:42.453
without a crater
or freckle to be seen.
没有火山口
或可见雀斑。

02:42.537 --> 02:45.039
Crater and freckles?
火山口和雀斑？

02:45.123 --> 02:46.207
In his office space
在他的办公空间里

02:46.291 --> 02:47.750
Mr. Normal, at least
至少正常先生

02:47.834 --> 02:49.544
that's what it says
on his name tag
就是这么说的
在他的名字标签上

02:49.627 --> 02:51.796
works at a steady
and monotonous pace
工作稳定
和单调的节奏

02:51.880 --> 02:54.173
just as all
the other normals do.
正如所有人一样
其他法线也是如此。

02:54.257 --> 02:56.593
Take note of
how they communicate
with each other.
请注意
他们如何沟通
与彼此。

02:56.676 --> 02:58.386
Hi, how
are you?
你好你好吗？

02:59.679 --> 03:00.847
at the end of the day
归根结底

03:00.930 --> 03:03.099
Mr. Normal packs his things
正常先生收拾东西

03:03.182 --> 03:06.853
and goes home to merrily start
the cycle again in the morning.
回家愉快地开始
早上再次循环。

03:06.936 --> 03:07.979
Yeah...
是的...

03:10.106 --> 03:12.066
I want one
Krabby Patty.
我想要一个
克拉比·帕蒂。

03:12.150 --> 03:14.611
SpongeBob, I need
one Krabby Patty.
海绵宝宝，我需要
一份蟹肉饼。

03:16.029 --> 03:18.281
what, no annoying blurbs today?
什么，今天没有烦人的简介吗？

03:19.782 --> 03:21.743
Hmm, strangely quiet.
嗯，出奇的安静。

03:28.082 --> 03:29.542
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

03:29.626 --> 03:31.210
Hi, how are you?
你好你好吗？

03:31.294 --> 03:32.545
What's the meaning of this?
这有什么意义呢？

03:32.629 --> 03:33.838
I took your advice.
我采纳了你的建议。

03:33.922 --> 03:35.048
From now on, I'm normal.
从现在开始，我就是正常人了。

03:36.966 --> 03:38.343
Normal, huh?
正常吧？

03:38.426 --> 03:39.385
Yup.
是的。

03:39.469 --> 03:40.929
Oh, really?
哦真的吗？

03:41.012 --> 03:41.971
Yup.
是的。

03:42.055 --> 03:43.681
Whatever.
任何。

03:43.765 --> 03:45.683
I know you're just waiting
to say something stupid.
我知道你只是在等待
说一些愚蠢的话。

03:45.767 --> 03:47.518
Wonderful weather
we're having.
天气真好
我们有。

03:48.811 --> 03:51.064
Uh, yes, it is.
呃，是的，是的。

03:51.147 --> 03:53.733
Ok, see you around.
好的，再见。

03:53.816 --> 03:55.443
Yeah, I'll, uh...
是的，我会，呃...

03:55.526 --> 03:56.444
I'll see you.
我会见到你。

03:58.196 --> 03:59.822
SpongeBob, what are you
doing sitting around?
海绵宝宝，你是什么
闲坐做什么？

03:59.906 --> 04:01.074
We need Krabby Patties
out there.
我们需要蟹肉饼
在那里。

04:01.157 --> 04:02.241
Yes, sir.
是的，先生。

04:02.325 --> 04:03.493
I'll do it normally.
我会正常做。

04:03.576 --> 04:04.619
Hey?
嘿？

04:08.206 --> 04:10.708
wow, that's all it takes
these days, huh?
哇，这就是所需要的
这几天吧？

04:10.792 --> 04:12.001
Can you do more?
你能做更多吗？

04:16.214 --> 04:17.840
Oh, my!
哦，天哪！

04:17.924 --> 04:19.884
It's like printing money.
这就像印钱一样。

04:23.596 --> 04:25.765
I wonder what
got into SpongeBob.
我想知道什么
进入了海绵宝宝。

04:25.848 --> 04:28.059
And what the heck is that?
那到底是什么？

04:28.142 --> 04:29.602
Squidward: Whose
house is this?
章鱼哥：谁的
房子是这个吗？

04:31.521 --> 04:33.022
Hi, how are you?
你好你好吗？

04:40.571 --> 04:41.614
Hi, SpongeBob.
嗨，海绵宝宝。

04:41.698 --> 04:43.282
Hi, how are you?
你好你好吗？

04:43.366 --> 04:45.368
Good, just coming by to
很好，刚好过来

04:45.451 --> 04:46.786
get a drink.
喝一杯。

04:46.869 --> 04:48.204
Wonderful weather
we're having.
天气真好
我们有。

04:48.287 --> 04:49.497
It sure is.
确实如此。

04:49.580 --> 04:50.623
Ok, see you 'round.
好的，再见。

04:50.707 --> 04:51.791
Yeah...  .
是的...  。

04:51.874 --> 04:53.710
See you  .
再见  。

04:53.793 --> 04:55.420
Oh, my  .
哦，我的。

04:55.503 --> 04:56.963
I could get used to this.
我可以习惯这个。

05:18.568 --> 05:19.819
French man: Three weeks later.
法国人：三周后。

05:19.902 --> 05:21.863
There you are, sir.
就在这儿，先生。

05:21.946 --> 05:24.574
Oh, yes, it's time
again  .
哦，是的，是时候了
再次。

05:24.657 --> 05:27.326
I've been meaning
to say this but
我一直想说
这么说但是

05:27.410 --> 05:30.163
I've come to appreciate
your demeanor lately.
我已经开始欣赏
你最近的神态。

05:30.246 --> 05:32.165
You know, it's
a funny thing, Squidward.
你知道，这是
有趣的是，章鱼哥。

05:32.248 --> 05:35.043
I smoothed out the edges
of my personality
我平滑了边缘
我的个性

05:35.126 --> 05:36.419
and the rest just
followed suit.
剩下的只是
也纷纷效仿。

05:36.502 --> 05:39.380
Now I am utterly normal.
现在我完全正常了。

05:45.928 --> 05:48.222
Ugh, that ain't right.
呃，那是不对的。

05:48.306 --> 05:51.184
I will never spend
money here again.
我永远不会花费
钱又来了。

05:51.267 --> 05:52.226
Never?
绝不？

05:52.310 --> 05:54.020
Come on, guys.
来吧，伙计们。

05:54.103 --> 05:54.729
These patties ain't worth
the paper they're printed on.
这些肉饼不值钱
打印它们的纸张。

05:55.688 --> 05:57.273
Wait, where you going?
等等，你要去哪里？

06:00.693 --> 06:02.987
Krabs: SpongeBob!
蟹蟹：海绵宝宝！

06:03.071 --> 06:04.697
What are you doing back here?
你回来做什么？

06:04.781 --> 06:07.200
Do you expect the customers
to eat this?
你期望顾客
吃这个？

06:07.283 --> 06:09.869
And now, thanks to you,
they're leaving in boat loads.
现在，多亏了你，
他们正满载船只离开。

06:12.622 --> 06:14.207
Maybe this thing is out of ink.
也许这东西没墨水了。

06:15.792 --> 06:17.418
No, boy, you're
missing the point.
不，孩子，你是
没有抓住要点。

06:17.502 --> 06:19.796
You can't make Krabby Patties
with ink and paper.
你不能做蟹黄馅饼
用墨水和纸。

06:19.879 --> 06:21.672
You gotta put your
heart into it, boy.
你必须把你的
心投入其中，男孩。

06:21.756 --> 06:24.008
Now get back to making them
patties the right way
现在回去制作它们
肉饼的正确做法

06:24.092 --> 06:26.010
and stop acting so dull.
别再表现得那么迟钝了。

06:26.094 --> 06:28.554
What you call dull
I call normal.
你所谓的沉闷
我称正常。

06:28.638 --> 06:31.891
Well, till you decide to
start making them patties
好吧，直到你决定
开始给他们做肉饼

06:31.974 --> 06:33.559
the way only you can
只有你能做到的方式

06:33.643 --> 06:35.311
I want you out of my place.
我要你离开我的位置。

06:38.898 --> 06:40.399
I guess the decision
to be normal
我猜这个决定
正常

06:40.483 --> 06:42.610
was more life changing
than I thought.
改变了更多的生活
比我想象的要多。

06:42.693 --> 06:44.570
Hi, how are you?
你好你好吗？

06:44.654 --> 06:46.405
What happened to you?
你怎么了？

06:46.489 --> 06:47.907
Oh, I got normal.
哦，我恢复正常了。

06:47.990 --> 06:49.492
Whatever that means.
不管那意味着什么。

06:49.575 --> 06:51.953
Hey, SpongeBob, what do you say
嘿，海绵宝宝，你说什么

06:52.036 --> 06:54.455
we charge into jellyfish fields
我们冲进水母区

06:54.539 --> 06:56.290
nets a-blaze?
网着火了？

06:56.374 --> 06:59.460
Let's do something normal
like window shopping.
我们来做点正常的事吧
就像逛街一样。

06:59.544 --> 07:00.962
Let's do this.
让我们这样做吧。

07:05.174 --> 07:06.425
Ah!
啊!

07:06.509 --> 07:07.760
Yeah-ha,
hey, your turn.
是啊哈，
嘿，轮到你了。

07:07.844 --> 07:09.428
I think I'll pass.
我想我会通过的。

07:09.512 --> 07:11.514
But I do need to
defragment my hard drive.
但我确实需要
对我的硬盘进行碎片整理。

07:11.597 --> 07:12.598
Would you like to help?
您愿意帮忙吗？

07:12.682 --> 07:14.142
Hey, listen...
嘿，听着……

07:14.225 --> 07:16.018
when you decide
to do something fun
当你决定时
做一些有趣的事情

07:16.102 --> 07:17.770
you know where
to find me.
你知道在哪里
来找我。

07:17.854 --> 07:20.064
Ok, see you around.
好的，再见。

07:21.816 --> 07:23.943
Hi, how are you?
你好你好吗？

07:24.026 --> 07:26.028
I never thought I'd
hear myself say this but
我从没想过我会
听到我自己这么说但是

07:26.112 --> 07:28.781
please come in, SpongeBob.
请进来，海绵宝宝。

07:28.865 --> 07:30.449
Thank you.
谢谢。

07:30.533 --> 07:32.994
Tell me, what are you doing
cooped up in here
告诉我，你在做什么
关在这儿

07:33.077 --> 07:35.663
when the weather outside
is so normal?
当外面的天气
有那么正常吗？

07:35.746 --> 07:37.206
Well, today is dusting day.
嗯，今天是除尘日。

07:37.290 --> 07:40.459
The day I dust
my 483 self-portraits.
我除尘的那一天
我的 483 张自画像。

07:40.543 --> 07:43.588
Wow, that's something you
don't see in the average house.
哇，那是你的东西
一般房子里看不到。

07:43.671 --> 07:47.800
You know, SpongeBob, it's ok
to be a little different.
你知道，海绵宝宝，没关系
有点不同。

07:49.385 --> 07:51.179
And you know what
else is abnormal?
你知道吗
不然不正常吗？

07:51.262 --> 07:53.848
Your nose- it's all
bulbous and flappy.
你的鼻子——这就是一切
球状且蓬松。

07:56.726 --> 07:59.103
Your eyes are
a little odd, too.
你的眼睛是
也有点奇怪。

07:59.187 --> 08:01.063
Looks like your whole face
could use some work.
看起来像你的整张脸
可以使用一些工作。

08:01.147 --> 08:03.608
Mm, yeah, there we go.
嗯，是的，我们开始了。

08:03.691 --> 08:05.109
See?
看？

08:05.193 --> 08:06.861
Looking normal already.
看起来已经很正常了

08:06.944 --> 08:08.446
What the...
什么...

08:08.529 --> 08:09.614
You don't wear pants.
你没穿裤子。

08:09.697 --> 08:12.116
And stay out of my home.
并且别来我家。

08:17.496 --> 08:19.582
Oh, what happened?
噢，发生什么事了？

08:19.665 --> 08:21.834
I lost my job and my best friend
我失去了工作和最好的朋友

08:21.918 --> 08:24.128
and now I'm too normal
for Squidward.
现在我太正常了
为了章鱼哥。

08:24.212 --> 08:26.797
Maybe I have taken this
normal thing too far.
也许我已经采取了这个
正常的事情太远了。

08:26.881 --> 08:28.633
No problem, SpongeBob.
没问题，海绵宝宝。

08:28.716 --> 08:30.259
You made yourself normal.
你让自己变得正常了。

08:30.343 --> 08:32.345
Now all you have to do
is reweird yourself.
现在你所要做的就是
是你自己很奇怪。

08:32.428 --> 08:35.973
All it'll take
is a mental adjustment
and some tight clenching.
一切都将需要
是一种心理调整
和一些紧握。

08:36.057 --> 08:38.017
Now focus...
现在重点...

08:38.100 --> 08:41.354
: And  clench.
: 并握紧。

08:47.902 --> 08:49.487
Oh, well...
那好吧...

08:49.570 --> 08:51.030
If I'm going to get weird
如果我会变得奇怪

08:51.113 --> 08:52.865
I'm going to need
to see a professional.
我需要
去看专业人士。

08:53.950 --> 08:55.910
: Look at my tongue.
: 看看我的舌头。

08:59.121 --> 09:00.373
That's very nice, Patrick
非常好，帕特里克

09:00.456 --> 09:02.750
but I need you to retrain me.
但我需要你重新训练我。

09:02.833 --> 09:05.044
I want to be abnormal again.
我想再次变得不正常。

09:05.127 --> 09:07.713
Huh, I don't think you
have what it takes.
呵呵，我不认为你
拥有所需的一切。

09:07.797 --> 09:09.548
Please, Patrick.
拜托，帕特里克。

09:09.632 --> 09:12.301
If anyone can teach me
the arcane art of
the weird, it's you.
如果有人可以教我
的神秘艺术
最奇怪的是你。

09:12.385 --> 09:15.054
Teach me to how
to be me, again.
教我如何
再次成为我。

09:15.137 --> 09:17.056
It won't be easy
这并不容易

09:17.139 --> 09:18.224
but I'll do it.
但我会做的。

09:18.307 --> 09:20.184
Oh, thank you, Patrick.
哦，谢谢你，帕特里克。

09:20.268 --> 09:22.895
But first, I'll need a garden
hose and a flatbed truck
但首先我需要一个花园
软管和平板卡车

09:22.979 --> 09:25.106
and I'll need you
to remove your trousers.
我需要你
脱掉你的裤子。

09:28.818 --> 09:31.570
Patrick, I'm feeling very
self-conscious right now.
帕特里克，我感觉很
现在有自我意识。

09:31.654 --> 09:35.199
Try to concentrate on your
first lesson in weird.
尝试集中精力于你的
奇怪的第一课。

09:35.283 --> 09:37.576
See you on the
other side, buddy.
见
另一边，伙计。

09:40.955 --> 09:43.582
Patrick: Oh, ho-ho...
帕特里克：噢，嗬嗬……

09:46.002 --> 09:47.086
Patrick: Whoo-hoo.
帕特里克：呼呼。

09:52.008 --> 09:53.592
Mommy, Mommy...
妈妈，妈妈……

09:53.676 --> 09:55.094
what are those things?
那些东西是什么？

09:55.177 --> 09:56.804
Those are
undesirables, honey.
那些是
不受欢迎的，亲爱的。

09:56.887 --> 09:58.222
We only talk
to normal people.
我们只说话
对正常人来说。

10:00.308 --> 10:03.019
SpongeBob, the weird
therapy is working.
海绵宝宝，奇怪的
治疗正在发挥作用。

10:03.102 --> 10:05.104
Your craters
are coming back.
你的陨石坑
正在回来。

10:05.187 --> 10:07.231
We just have to keep
pushing the boundaries.
我们只需要保持
突破界限。

10:07.315 --> 10:09.483
We've gotta get stranger.
我们必须变得陌生了。

10:26.459 --> 10:28.002
Talk backwards.
倒着说。

10:28.085 --> 10:29.962
"Chap Beru suoy era?"
“Chap Beru suoy时代？”

10:42.725 --> 10:44.477
Mmm...
嗯...

10:48.939 --> 10:49.607
What's happening?
发生什么事了？

10:52.026 --> 10:53.569
The final transformation.
最后的转变。

10:57.573 --> 10:58.616
Huh?
啊？

10:58.699 --> 10:59.658
What happened?
发生了什么？

10:59.742 --> 11:01.160
I don't know.
我不知道。

11:01.243 --> 11:03.496
I guess I became
permanently normal.
我想我变成了
永久正常。

11:03.579 --> 11:05.581
No!
不！

11:05.664 --> 11:08.084
