for SpongeBob.
我在找
对于海绵宝宝。

11:17.426 --> 11:18.177
Hi.
你好。

11:21.514 --> 11:22.431
How are you?
你好吗？

11:25.684 --> 11:28.354
SpongeBob, you're back
to your square shape.
海绵宝宝你回来了
到你的正方形。

11:28.437 --> 11:31.065
Wow, I guess
Squidward's normal looks
哇，我猜
章鱼哥的正常外貌

11:31.148 --> 11:33.192
scared me back
to my original form.
吓我回来
到我原来的形式。

11:33.275 --> 11:36.028
Thank, buddy,
you saved my life.
谢谢，哥们，
你救了我的命。

11:36.112 --> 11:37.655
Wonderful weather
we're having, hm?
天气真好
我们有，嗯？

11:37.738 --> 11:40.616
It sure is, buddy.
确实如此，伙计。

11:40.699 --> 11:41.909
It sure is.
确实如此。

12:09.019 --> 12:11.021
Ooh...
哦...

12:16.819 --> 12:18.028
... Whoa.
... 哇。

12:19.697 --> 12:24.076
Gary, come and get it.
加里，过来拿它。

12:28.664 --> 12:29.707
Gary...
加里...

12:29.790 --> 12:31.459
Gary?
加里？

12:31.542 --> 12:32.418
Gary.
加里.

12:32.501 --> 12:33.419
Gary?
加里？

12:33.502 --> 12:34.962
Gary!
加里！

12:35.045 --> 12:38.007
Huh? Gary must've gotten
an early start.
啊？加里一定已经得到了
早点开始。

12:41.969 --> 12:43.971
Rise and shine, Squidward.
崛起并闪耀，章鱼哥。

12:44.054 --> 12:45.848
You don't wanna be late again.
你不想再迟到了。

12:45.931 --> 12:49.059
Ok, see you at the Krusty Krab.
好的，我们蟹堡王见。

12:49.143 --> 12:50.978
Guess Squidward needs
his beauty sleep.
猜猜章鱼哥需要什么
他的美容觉。

12:51.061 --> 12:55.024
Not everyone is blessed
with my natural good looks.
不是每个人都被祝福
以我天生的美貌。

12:55.107 --> 12:58.110
Patrick, it's morning.
帕特里克，早上了。

12:58.194 --> 13:00.446
You don't wanna
forget to wake up again.
你不想
忘记再次醒来。

13:00.529 --> 13:03.365
Patrick?
帕特里克？

13:03.449 --> 13:07.203
Ok, see you after
work, sleepyhead.
好的，稍后见
工作，瞌睡虫。

13:15.586 --> 13:16.712
♪ La-la-la, la, la-la-la ♪
♪ 啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦 ♪

13:28.891 --> 13:30.059
Hm, slow day.
嗯，缓慢的一天。

13:30.142 --> 13:32.144
Good night, Squidward.
晚安，章鱼哥。

13:32.228 --> 13:33.562
Good night, Mr. Krabs.
晚安，蟹老板。

13:38.776 --> 13:41.946
Gary, I'm home.
加里，我回来了。

13:42.029 --> 13:43.822
Gary, you here, buddy?
加里，你在吗，伙计？

13:43.906 --> 13:45.950
Gary?
加里？

13:47.409 --> 13:49.119
He hasn't touched his food.
他没有碰过他的食物。

13:49.203 --> 13:51.038
: Squidward!
: 乌贼王！

13:51.121 --> 13:52.957
Open up!
打开！

13:54.333 --> 13:56.126
Squidward, have you seen Gary?
章鱼哥，你看到加里了吗？

13:56.210 --> 13:56.794
He's gone missing.
他失踪了。

13:58.754 --> 14:00.214
Squidward?
章鱼哥？

14:00.297 --> 14:02.216
Not a sign
of Squidward anywhere.
不是一个迹象
章鱼哥在任何地方。

14:03.634 --> 14:05.553
Squidward?
章鱼哥？

14:05.636 --> 14:07.429
You up here?
你在上面吗？

14:08.806 --> 14:10.975
Hm, Squidward's clarinet.
嗯，章鱼哥的单簧管。

14:11.058 --> 14:13.477
Um, um, um...
嗯，嗯，嗯……

14:17.189 --> 14:18.732
It's not even warm.
甚至都不热。

14:18.816 --> 14:20.693
Squidward's missing, too.
章鱼哥也失踪了。

14:20.776 --> 14:22.486
Patrick! Open up.
帕特里克！打开。

14:22.570 --> 14:24.280
Squidward and Gary are missing.
章鱼哥和加里失踪了。

14:28.492 --> 14:30.035
Patrick's gone too.
帕特里克也走了。

14:30.119 --> 14:32.246
What if everybody's gone?
如果大家都走了怎么办？

14:34.456 --> 14:36.166
SpongeBob: Mr. Krabs!
海绵宝宝：蟹老板！

14:37.376 --> 14:39.211
He's gone, too.
他也走了。

14:39.295 --> 14:41.964
Sandy... She's gone.
桑迪……她走了。

14:42.047 --> 14:43.966
Gone.
走了。

14:44.049 --> 14:45.843
Gone.
走了。

14:45.926 --> 14:47.678
Gone.
走了。

14:47.761 --> 14:48.887
Gone.
走了。

14:48.971 --> 14:50.889
Gone!
走了！

14:54.893 --> 14:59.189
Where did everybody go...
大家都去哪儿了...

14:59.273 --> 15:01.900
: go...
： 去...

15:01.984 --> 15:03.235
go...
去...

15:03.319 --> 15:05.654
...go?
...去？

15:05.738 --> 15:07.406
Everybody's gone.
大家都走了。

15:07.489 --> 15:09.908
But I swear that
I will keep the memory
但我发誓
我会保留记忆

15:09.992 --> 15:12.244
of Bikini Bottom alive
比基尼泳裤还活着

15:12.328 --> 15:14.872
