SpongeBob: Coming up, Squidward.
海绵宝宝：来了，章鱼哥。

16:19.687 --> 16:21.522
SpongeBob: Excuse me, Sandy.
海绵宝宝：对不起，桑迪。

16:21.605 --> 16:24.650
