this delicious ice tea?
但我可以再多一些吗
这美味的冰茶？

16:24.733 --> 16:26.276
:
Why sure.
：
为什么肯定。

16:26.360 --> 16:28.153
Oop, just a sec.
哎呀，等一下。

16:29.738 --> 16:30.906
Ah! Ooh.
啊!哦。

16:30.989 --> 16:33.701
Why sho' 'nuff, SpongeBob.
为什么要生气呢，海绵宝宝。

16:33.784 --> 16:35.494
:
Good morning, class.
：
早上好，同学们。

16:35.577 --> 16:37.996
Can anyone tell me
the first thing you do
谁能告诉我
你做的第一件事

16:38.080 --> 16:39.832
when driving a boat?
驾驶船时？

16:39.915 --> 16:43.001
Ah, um, floor it?
啊，嗯，地板吗？

16:43.085 --> 16:45.421
That's right, you floor it.
没错，你把它铺平了。

16:45.504 --> 16:47.965
Excellent work, SpongeBob.
干得好，海绵宝宝。

16:48.048 --> 16:50.175
Why, thank you Mrs.
何必呢，谢谢小姐姐

16:50.259 --> 16:54.972
Pu... Puff  .
噗……噗。

16:55.055 --> 16:56.557
This is pointless.
这是毫无意义的。

16:56.640 --> 16:58.851
I know, Mrs. Puff.
我知道，帕夫夫人。

16:58.934 --> 17:02.312
: I can't
replace everyone.
: 我不能
替换所有人。

17:02.396 --> 17:06.275
I'll never be happy again.
我永远不会再快乐了。

17:07.443 --> 17:09.903
Ooh, blank driver's license.
哦，空白驾照。

17:15.784 --> 17:17.911
That's the baby.
那就是婴儿。

17:17.995 --> 17:20.289
Hi, fella, it's me.
嗨，伙计，是我。

17:25.335 --> 17:26.754
it's ok, I'm licensed.
没关系，我有授权。

17:26.837 --> 17:29.048
♪ La, la-la-la, la, la, la ♪
♪ 啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦 ♪

17:30.758 --> 17:32.468
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

17:32.551 --> 17:34.344
Listen to that purr.
听那咕噜声。

17:35.679 --> 17:37.055
♪ La, la, la-la-la... ♪
♪ 啦，啦，啦啦啦……♪

17:37.139 --> 17:39.057
♪ La, la, la... ♪
♪ 啦，啦，啦……♪

17:39.141 --> 17:41.018
♪ La, la, la... ♪
♪ 啦，啦，啦……♪

17:42.644 --> 17:44.062
♪ La, la-la-la, la ♪
♪ 啦，啦啦啦，啦 ♪

17:44.146 --> 17:45.397
♪ La, la, la-la ♪
♪ 啦啦啦啦 ♪

17:45.481 --> 17:47.066
♪ La-la, la-la... ♪
♪ 啦啦，啦啦……♪

17:49.318 --> 17:51.779
♪ La-la-la-la, la, la... ♪
♪ 啦啦啦啦，啦啦啦……♪

17:59.453 --> 18:02.748
Mmm, good night, Boatie.
嗯，晚安，博蒂。

18:02.831 --> 18:06.418
SpongeBob: Uh, uh, uh, wha...
海绵宝宝：呃呃呃呃呃……

18:06.502 --> 18:07.544
Ah, ah!
啊啊啊！

18:07.628 --> 18:09.296
Ah, ha, no, no...
啊哈，不，不……

18:09.379 --> 18:12.132
No!
不！

18:13.842 --> 18:15.594
Oh, Gary,
I had a nightmare
哦，加里，
我做了一个噩梦

18:15.677 --> 18:17.513
that all my friends were gone
我所有的朋友都走了

18:17.596 --> 18:19.932
and I was
driving a...  .
我当时
驾驶着...

18:21.266 --> 18:23.352
So it was true.
所以这是真的。

18:23.435 --> 18:26.105
I guess it's just
you and me now, Boatie.
我想这只是
现在你和我，博蒂。

18:50.629 --> 18:52.130
This is where I work.
这是我工作的地方。

18:52.214 --> 18:54.299
Wanna help me cook up
some Krabby Patties?
想帮我做饭
一些蟹黄馅饼？

18:54.383 --> 18:55.509
Great.
伟大的。

19:03.433 --> 19:07.271
Back when everyone was around
they used to really enjoy these.
当大家都在身边的时候
他们曾经非常喜欢这些。

19:07.354 --> 19:08.939
Here, try one.
来，尝试一下。

19:11.191 --> 19:14.987
What? You don't
like Krabby Patties?
什么？你不
像蟹黄饼一样？

19:15.070 --> 19:16.822
Huh.
呵呵。

19:16.905 --> 19:19.491
Well, I guess we can
still make this work.
好吧，我想我们可以
仍然使这项工作有效。

19:23.161 --> 19:24.621
Oh, boy...
哦，男孩……

19:24.705 --> 19:27.499
We learned a lot
about each other today.
我们学到了很多
今天关于彼此。

19:27.583 --> 19:29.209
You know, I thought I'd go crazy
你知道吗，我以为我会发疯

19:29.293 --> 19:31.920
without all my friends
and acquaintances around
没有我所有的朋友
以及周围的熟人

19:32.004 --> 19:36.091
but it looks like  you  were
all I needed to stay sane.
但看起来你是
我需要保持理智的一切。

19:37.718 --> 19:40.888
What? A puppet
of my old best friend?
什么？一个木偶
我最好的老朋友？

19:42.514 --> 19:45.475
Made entirely
of Krabby Patty meat?
完全制作
蟹肉饼肉？

19:47.519 --> 19:49.771
Oh, Boatie, you are a card.
哦，博蒂，你是一张卡片。

19:52.482 --> 19:54.067
Sorry I'm late, Patrick.
抱歉我迟到了，帕特里克。

19:54.151 --> 19:55.861
Boatie was
telling me a joke.
博蒂是
给我讲个笑话。

19:57.738 --> 19:59.489
SpongeBob: You're awfully
chummy with that guy
海绵宝宝：你太糟糕了
和那个家伙交好

19:59.573 --> 20:02.618
for someone who has
it out for you.
对于有的人
为你准备好了。

20:02.701 --> 20:04.119
Who, Boatie?
谁，博蒂？

20:04.202 --> 20:06.455
No, no, he's...
不不不，他是……

20:06.538 --> 20:07.581
Really?
真的吗？

20:07.664 --> 20:08.999
I can't talk now.
我现在不能说话。

20:09.082 --> 20:10.709
He's watching us.
他在看着我们。

20:10.792 --> 20:13.003
Wait, Patrick, don't go.
等等，帕特里克，别走。

20:15.047 --> 20:16.340
Huh?
啊？

20:16.423 --> 20:19.259
Nothing, Boatie.
没什么，博蒂。

20:19.343 --> 20:21.511
I'm just going to bed.
我要去睡觉了。

20:22.846 --> 20:24.723
French man: Three days later.
法国人：三天后。

20:24.806 --> 20:28.769
"Dear diary, not sure if
I can trust any vehicle.
“亲爱的日记，不知道是否
我可以信任任何车辆。

20:28.852 --> 20:31.480
Run for it as soon
as the coast is clear."
尽快跑去吧
因为海岸畅通无阻。”

20:54.211 --> 20:55.253
Ah, ah!
啊啊啊！

21:05.180 --> 21:06.056
Ah, ah, ahh...
啊啊啊啊……

21:11.103 --> 21:12.312
Huh?
啊？

21:12.396 --> 21:13.897
Sheesh,
calm down, boy.
谢什，
冷静点，男孩。

21:13.981 --> 21:16.191
You're all
still alive?
你们都是
还活着吗？

21:16.274 --> 21:17.693
But where did you go?
但你去哪儿了？

21:17.776 --> 21:19.569
It was national
"No SpongeBob Day".
原来是全国性的
“没有海绵宝宝日”。

21:19.653 --> 21:21.697
National "No SpongeBob Day"?
全国“无海绵宝宝日”？

21:21.780 --> 21:23.782
Yeah, a whole day dedicated
是的，一整天的奉献

21:23.865 --> 21:25.617
to getting away from you.
远离你。

21:25.701 --> 21:28.328
A day? But you guys have
been away for weeks.
一天？但你们有
已经离开好几个星期了。

21:28.412 --> 21:30.080
Uh...  .
呃....

21:30.163 --> 21:32.207
Yeah, well, we kind of
milked it a little.
是的，好吧，我们有点
挤一点奶。

21:35.127 --> 21:37.129
You too, Patrick?
你也是吗，帕特里克？

21:37.212 --> 21:38.714
: Yeah.
： 是的。

21:38.797 --> 21:41.425
Everybody needs at least
one day away from...
每个人至少需要
有一天，远离...

21:44.886 --> 21:47.180
Well,
glad you had fun.
嗯，
很高兴你玩得开心。

21:47.264 --> 21:49.808
Aw, cheer up, boy.
噢，振作起来，男孩。

21:49.891 --> 21:52.310
It's a whole day
inspired by you.
已经是一整天了
受到你的启发。

21:52.394 --> 21:54.021
Really?
真的吗？

21:54.104 --> 21:55.647
Of course.
当然。

21:55.731 --> 21:58.066
First we build
a giant wooden effigy of you.
首先我们构建
你的巨型木制雕像。

21:58.150 --> 22:00.027
Then we burn it to the ground.
然后我们把它烧毁。

22:00.110 --> 22:01.486
Krabs: Whoo-hoo.
螃蟹：呼呼。

22:01.570 --> 22:03.280
Krabs: Burn baby, whoo.
螃蟹：烧伤宝贝，呼。

22:03.363 --> 22:05.782
Krabs: And dance on the ashes
like there was no tomorrow.
螃蟹：在灰烬上跳舞
就像没有明天一样。

22:08.035 --> 22:09.036
Wow.
哇。

22:09.119 --> 22:12.164
A whole day dedicated to me.
一整天都奉献给我。

22:14.082 --> 22:15.292
Big deal.
有什么大不了的。

22:15.375 --> 22:16.918
Wait'll you see
"No Patrick Day".
等等你会看到
“没有帕特里克节”。

22:17.002 --> 22:19.755
Come on, everyone,
let's go.
来吧，大家，
我们走吧。

22:23.467 --> 22:24.760
Ooh.
哦。

22:27.679 --> 22:30.640
Where did everybody go?
大家都去哪儿了？

22:30.724 --> 22:31.850
Hello?
你好？

22:35.270 --> 22:36.313
